--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ReadMe         80        .   This file
table.dat     208      255   Star list sorted by equatorial coordinates
                             and access to individual spectra
obs_sp/*       .       258   Observed individual spectra
cor_sp/*       .       255   Individual spectra, corrected for interstellar
                             extinction and radial velocity
